ttps://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":9939,"digest":"sha256:205096b24877a495d7369efccbd4e563399862b89c760205dbf4f26b5b9f4004","download_count":2,"created_at":"2026-11-05T19:46:02Z","updated_at":"2026-11-05T19:46:02Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/asamarts/alint/releases/download/v0.21.1/SHA256SUMS.cosign.bundle"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asamarts/alint/releases/assets/714596339","id":714596339,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSGVK6M4ql9_z","name":"THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.html","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"text/html; charset=utf-8","state":"uploaded","size":392921,"digest":"sha256:ff6ff6201059dd07710735818ff8908c71fa2e722bc299908ac9fd6bf6ff538f","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-11-05T19:46:02Z","updated_at":"2026-11-05T19:46:02Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/asamarts/alint/releases/download/v0.21.1/THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.html"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asamarts/alint/tarball/v0.21.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asamarts/alint/zipball/v0.21.1","body":"## What's Changed\n* docs: pin the published Action to v0.21.0 and record the release by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/421\n* perf(core): look up nested glob options with a match by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/422\n* docs(bench): v0.21.0 bench-scale results by @github-actions[bot] in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/424\n* chore(contract): pin witforge 0.1.2 by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/423\n* docs(v0.21): record the post-release steps and the micro gate fix by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/425\n* chore(deps)(deps): bump the patch-and-minor group with 5 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/427\n* fix(config): keep structural configuration errors readable by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/431\n* ci: run mutants on pull requests, check advisories daily, and verify action pins by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/432\n* test(core): pin nested glob options for every kind spelling by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/433\n* fix(walker): read a linked worktree's shared exclude in would_walk_skip by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/435\n* docs: record v0.21.0 as shipped, mark every benchmark reset, and add v0.22 to the roadmap by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/434\n* refactor(walker): move the tests to walker_tests.rs by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/436\n* chore(actions)(deps): bump the actions-patch-and-minor group across 1 directory with 2 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/428\n* chore(deps)(deps-dev): bump @vscode/vsce from 4.0.0 to 4.1.0 in /editors/vscode in the vscode-patch-and-minor group across 1 directory by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/430\n* ci: close review gaps in the pin, Summary and mutants gates, and correct docs by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/437\n* fix(config): keep numbers and top-level environment values out of config errors by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/438\n* fix(walker): predict walk exclusions the way ignore 0.4.34 applies them by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/439\n* ci: close the follow-up gaps in the pin, release and mutants scripts by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/440\n* fix(config): keep environment values out of the remaining errors and warnings by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/442\n* fix(walker): stop ignore files at the repository boundary by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/443\n* chore(ci): update the witforge consumer to 0.2.0 by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/441\n* fix(walker): close the boundary review's gaps in the walk and the dry run by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/444\n* fix(config): close the remaining environment-value leaks in errors, warnings and listings by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/445\n* fix(fix): judge a dry-run create by where it lands and as the real fix resolves it by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/446\n* fix(config): keep env-derived paths and patterns out of fix warnings and hints, and keep 0.21.0 crates building by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/447\n* chore(release): prepare v0.21.1 by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/448\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/asamarts/alint/compare/v0.21.0...v0.21.1","mentions_count":2}